  "introduction": "The AI Club, IITM is the center of the Student community at IIT Madras. We do rigorous AI Research and implementation, with the freedom of choosing ambitious problems to solve and rapidly iterating on various directions. Through workshops, sessions and hackathons, we foster a culture of hands-on learning. Our members represent IITM at top hackathons across the country and contribute to the AI Community through meaningful research and Open-source projects.",
